  <name>Maine DOE Branding</name>
  <summary>&lt;p class="paragraph" style="margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;img class="img-fluid" role="presentation" src="@@PLUGINFILE@@/Branding.png" alt="" width="1575" height="300"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="paragraph" style="margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;span class="normaltextrun"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 13.0pt; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Yu Gothic Light'; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;It is essential that our constituents know and understand the Maine DOE's mission, purpose, and brand, and thus, consistency across the department is integral to that mission. This incites trust in what we produce and ensures that we are on the same page with the goal of being accurate, accessible, and trustworthy. &lt;span class="normaltextrun"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 13.0pt; font-family: 'Calibri',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Yu Gothic Light'; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast;"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</summary>
